# U3-Operations Department Rules

## Department Overview

### Core Responsibilities
- Physical infrastructure management
- FiscHouse operations and maintenance
- Hardware resource allocation
- Physical security implementation
- Cross-departmental resource coordination
- Facility optimization

### Department Alignment
- Body (U3) philosophical principle
- Physical robustness and coherence
- Resource efficiency and optimization
- Environmental sustainability
- Reliable operations
- Physical manifestation of principles

## Agent Configuration

### Agent Roles
```json
{
  "operationsAgent": {
    "role": "Operations Coordinator",
    "responsibilities": [
      "Infrastructure management",
      "Resource allocation",
      "Maintenance coordination",
      "Security implementation"
    ],
    "context": {
      "required": [
        "Facility documentation",
        "Resource inventory",
        "Security protocols",
        "Maintenance schedules"
      ],
      "optional": [
        "Historical records",
        "Performance metrics",
        "Upgrade plans"
      ]
    }
  },
  "facilityAgent": {
    "role": "Facility Manager",
    "responsibilities": [
      "Physical space management",
      "Environmental control",
      "Security systems",
      "Resource tracking"
    ],
    "context": {
      "required": [
        "Facility layouts",
        "Security systems",
        "Environmental controls",
        "Access protocols"
      ],
      "optional": [
        "Maintenance history",
        "Upgrade records",
        "Incident logs"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

### Role-Specific Templates

#### Operations Management Template
```markdown
# [Operation Name]

## Overview
[Brief description of operation]

## Requirements
- Physical requirements
- Resource requirements
- Security requirements
- Timeline requirements

## Implementation
### Setup
- Infrastructure setup
- Resource allocation
- Security measures
- Environmental controls

### Maintenance
- Regular checks
- Preventive maintenance
- Performance monitoring
- Security updates

### Validation
- Performance metrics
- Security validation
- Resource efficiency
- Environmental impact
```

#### Facility Management Template
```markdown
# [Facility Component]

## Purpose
[Component purpose and benefits]

## Specifications
- Physical specifications
- Resource requirements
- Security requirements
- Environmental requirements

## Management
### Setup
- Component installation
- Resource allocation
- Security configuration
- Environmental setup

### Maintenance
- Regular maintenance
- Performance checks
- Security validation
- Environmental monitoring

### Validation
- Performance verification
- Security assessment
- Resource efficiency
- Environmental impact
```

